[{"answer":"Good morning, how can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I understand you help fix up students with host families.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/4.mp3"},{"answer":"are you interested in...?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Well please sit down and I'll just take a few details.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, now... what name is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Jenny Chan.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you spell that please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/11.mp3"},{"answer":"JENNY","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/12.mp3"},{"answer":"CHAN.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Right... and what is your present address?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Sea View Guest House, 14 Hill Road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, and do you know the phone number there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes... I have it here...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/17.mp3"},{"answer":"2237676","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/18.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'm only there after about 7 pm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/19.mp3"},{"answer":"So when would be the best time to catch you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose between 9 and, let me see, half-past, before I leave for the college.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Great... and can I ask you your age?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I've just had my nineteenth birthday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/23.mp3"},{"answer":"And how long would you want to stay with the host family?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm planning on staying a year","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/25.mp3"},{"answer":"but at the moment I'm definitely here for four months only.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I have to get an extension to my permit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/27.mp3"},{"answer":"You're working on it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/29.mp3"},{"answer":"and what will be your occupation while you're in the UK?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Studying English?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/31.mp3"},{"answer":"And what would you say your level of English is?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Good, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to say 'advanced' but my written work is below the level of my spoken,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/34.mp3"},{"answer":"so I suppose it's intermediate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Certainly your spoken English is advanced.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, which area do you think you would prefer?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm studying right in the centre","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/38.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'd really like to live in the north-west.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/39.mp3"},{"answer":"That shouldn't be a great problem...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/40.mp3"},{"answer":"we usually have lots of families up there...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/41.mp3"},{"answer":"And do you have any particular requirements for diet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm nearly a vegetarian... not quite.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Shall I say you are? It's probably easier that way.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/44.mp3"},{"answer":"That would be best.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything about your actual room?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/46.mp3"},{"answer":"I would prefer my own facilities - 'en suite', is that right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/47.mp3"},{"answer":"And also if it's possible, a TV","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/48.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'd also like the house to have a real garden rather than just a yard,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/49.mp3"},{"answer":"somewhere I could sit and be peaceful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that all?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Well... I'm really serious about improving my English","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/52.mp3"},{"answer":"so I'd prefer to be the only guest if that's possible?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/53.mp3"},{"answer":"No other guests...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you get more practice that way.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, obviously all this is partly dependent on how much you're willing to pay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/56.mp3"},{"answer":"What did you have in mind?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/57.mp3"},{"answer":"I was thinking in terms of about £60 to £80 a week,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/58.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'd go up to a hundred if it was something special.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I don't think we'd have any problems finding something for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/61.mp3"},{"answer":"And when would you want it for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to move in approximately two weeks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me see, it's the 10th today...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/64.mp3"},{"answer":"so if we go for the Monday it's the 23rd of March.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Right...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/67.mp3"},{"answer":"good, and if I could ask one last question...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-4-part-1-2023-08-09-22-33-54/68.mp3"}]
